a. `AuditUnit` adds `contentHash`.
b. Exam branch: `contentHash: revision`-valued.
c. `saveReviewCheckpoints` unchanged (already takes contentHash — callers pass unit.contentHash).
d. `unitAudited(receipts, unit, sourceHash)`: `receipt.contentHash === unit.contentHash`.
e. `startUnitAudit`: `contentHash: unit.contentHash` for both runReviewPass and checkpoints ✔ (checkpoint call currently uses unit.revision).
