h. `takePendingFindings`: filter in-memory task receipts by current revision; use `unit.contentHash`.
i. `scheduleUnitAudits`: unchanged except it now compares revisions (evidence) via unit.revision ✔ automatically.
j. Save-time invalidation of stale-evidence receipts (prune) — in the notes `saveNotes` mutation (Learn only). Also: the same invalidation should run for the *Tutor* path? Tutor units have no evidence beyond markdown ⇒ no.
